        {
            "title": "國際｜習近平深圳會晤阿努廷 促中泰嚴打網賭電詐",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜習近平深圳會晤阿努廷 促中泰嚴打網賭電詐\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/616f0ec9de9bd5e8d7347b61a0073cd0f87aa623da92ff7e3eadbb2565717b9a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜習近平深圳會晤阿努廷 促中泰嚴打網賭電詐</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">國家主席習近平在深圳與出席亞太經合組織領導人非正式會議的泰國總理阿努廷會面。習近平提出，中泰要密切政府、政黨及立法機構交往，加強經貿、科技和數字經濟合作，並加大打擊網上賭博及電訊詐騙等犯罪，為人員往來營造更安全環境。中方亦願為泰柬關係改善發揮積極作用。阿努廷表示，泰國將堅決打擊跨國犯罪，保護在泰中國公民安全，並期待中方繼續調解泰柬邊境衝突。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT YouTube channel:<br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2FgJTen;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2FgJTen</a></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E6%9C%83%E6%99%A4%E9%98%BF%E5%8A%AA%E5%BB%B7-%E4%BF%83%E4%B8%AD%E6%B3%B0%E5%9A%B4%E6%89%93%E7%B6%B2%E8%B3%AD%E9%9B%BB%E8%A9%90-073054372.html",
